{"ID":"20240504154003-ytj2ail","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240504154003-ytj2ail","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240504154003-ytj2ail\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240617145327-t7uca5r\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240606171350-wu6qwgw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"010空青","updated":"20240617153950"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240617145327-t7uca5r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617145327-t7uca5r","updated":"20240617150640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240617150623-ouirfyp.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]}]},{"ID":"20240617150641-h0lfk7s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617150641-h0lfk7s","updated":"20240617150641"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240617150230-7hte531.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]}]},{"ID":"20240617151023-r331vyv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617151023-r331vyv","updated":"20240617153950"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 413px;","style":"width: 403px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"空青20240617_153904"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/空青20240617_153904-20240617153950-inontmn.gif"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 403px;\" parent-style=\"width: 413px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240617150437-213do8k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617150437-213do8k","updated":"20240617151021"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240617150437-2pxzsho.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240614153157-h7yiefg","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614153157-h7yiefg"}},{"ID":"20240614153158-25qdllg","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614153158-25qdllg","updated":"20240614153203"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"空青《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240614153158-nuaffjq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153158-nuaffjq","updated":"20240614153158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153158-0kkdbpr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153158-0kkdbpr","updated":"20240614153158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主眚盲，耳聋。明目，利九窍，通血脉，养精神。久服，轻身延年不老。能化铜铁铅锡作金。生山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153158-13vlz91","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153158-13vlz91","updated":"20240614153158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《吴普》曰：空青，神农甘，一经酸，久服，有神仙玉女来时，使人志高（《御览》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153158-lwv2byw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153158-lwv2byw","updated":"20240614153158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：生益州及越巂山有铜处，铜精熏则生空青，其腹中空，三月中旬，采，亦无时。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153158-51hkkpb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153158-51hkkpb","updated":"20240614153158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《西山经》云：皇人之山，其下多青；郭璞云：空青曾青之属；《范子计然》云：空青出巴郡；《司马相如赋》云：丹青，张揖云青，青也；颜师古云：青，今之丹青也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153229-o5qit5e","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614153229-o5qit5e"}},{"ID":"20240614153230-mqj9imf","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614153230-mqj9imf","updated":"20240614153235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"空青《本草从新》"}]},{"ID":"20240614153230-31i7ap6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153230-31i7ap6","updated":"20240614153230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"重、明目．"}]},{"ID":"20240614153230-rpp5jv2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153230-rpp5jv2","updated":"20240614153230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘酸而寒．益肝明目．通窍利水．产铜坑中．大块中空．有水者良．（世多伪为之、亦中空有水、须细审之．）"}]},{"ID":"20240614153322-x1wc7z2","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614153322-x1wc7z2"}},{"ID":"20240614153323-asjdxl9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614153323-asjdxl9","updated":"20240614153327"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"空青《药性切用》"}]},{"ID":"20240614153323-66gxq7p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153323-66gxq7p","updated":"20240614153323"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘酸性寒，益肝明目，通窍利水。中空有水者良。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153311-1ezp9af","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614153311-1ezp9af"}},{"ID":"20240614153313-buh2zta","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614153313-buh2zta","updated":"20240614153318"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"空青《本草衍义》"}]},{"ID":"20240614153313-knbx3mg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153313-knbx3mg","updated":"20240614153313"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功长于治眼。仁庙朝，尝诏御药院，须中空有水者，将赐近戚，久而方得。其杨梅青，治医极有功。中亦或有水者，其用与空青同，第有优劣耳。今信州冗山而取，世谓之杨梅青，极难得。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153300-j7bnh08","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614153300-j7bnh08"}},{"ID":"20240614153302-jhmali9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614153302-jhmali9","updated":"20240614153307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"空青《冯氏锦囊秘录》"}]},{"ID":"20240614153302-rf3px26","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153302-rf3px26","updated":"20240614153302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"感铜之精气而结，味甘、酸，气大寒，无毒。甘寒能除积热，兼之以酸，则火自敛矣。且得金气，可以平肝而主目盲，盖多怒则火起于肝，水虚则火起于肾，故生内外翳障，令肝平火熄目自明矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153302-612etmm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153302-612etmm","updated":"20240614153302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"空青，生有铜处所，能化铜铁铅锡作金。专治赤肿青盲，回明去暗，其浆为点眼仙丹，壳亦磨翳要药，有云“不怕人间多瞎眼，只愁世上无空青”。绿青，画者多求。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153302-c53d6do","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153302-c53d6do","updated":"20240614153302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有青白花纹，吐风痰甚捷。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153249-wfs0ilq","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614153249-wfs0ilq"}},{"ID":"20240614153250-5u237b9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614153250-5u237b9","updated":"20240614153256"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"空青《本草衍义》"}]},{"ID":"20240614153250-d7iz864","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153250-d7iz864","updated":"20240614153250"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功长于治眼。仁庙朝，尝诏御药院，须中空有水者，将赐近戚，久而方得。其杨梅青，治医极有功。中亦或有水者，其用与空青同，第有优劣耳。今信州冗山而取，世谓之杨梅青，极难得。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153239-f7nucen","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614153239-f7nucen"}},{"ID":"20240614153240-xjxzem3","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614153240-xjxzem3","updated":"20240614153245"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"空青《本草备要》"}]},{"ID":"20240614153240-hx6xs61","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153240-hx6xs61","updated":"20240614153240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"重，明目"}]},{"ID":"20240614153240-2jckw2g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153240-2jckw2g","updated":"20240614153240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘酸而寒。益肝明目，通窍利水。产铜坑中。大块、中空有水者良。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153220-ppijwzh","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614153220-ppijwzh"}},{"ID":"20240614153221-6v46lon","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614153221-6v46lon","updated":"20240614153225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"空青《本经逢原》"}]},{"ID":"20240614153221-kstj6tg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153221-kstj6tg","updated":"20240614153221"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘酸大寒，无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153221-hbrb81u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153221-hbrb81u","updated":"20240614153221"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》主青盲耳聋，明目，利九窍，通血脉，养精神，益肝气，久服轻身延年。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153221-bhigdt6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153221-bhigdt6","updated":"20240614153221"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"发明"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"空青感铜之精气而结，故专入肝明目。《本经》主耳目九窍诸病，皆通血脉，养精神，益肝气之力也。久服轻身延年者，铜性善涤垢秽，垢秽去而气血清纯，毋伐天和矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153221-gi87yb9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153221-gi87yb9","updated":"20240614153221"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"时珍曰∶空青与绿青皆生益州及越 山有铜处。东方甲乙是生肝胆，其气之清者为肝血，其精英为胆汁，开窍于目。血者，五脏之英，皆因而注之为神。胆汁充则目明，减则目昏。铜亦青阳之气所生，其气之清者为绿，犹肝血也。其精英为空青之浆，犹胆汁也，其为治目神药。盖亦以类相感耳。但世罕得真，医亦罕识。以故俗谚云∶“天下有空青，人间无瞽目”之说。不知此虽贵品，铜官始兴。凉州、高平、饶信等处亦皆有之。出铜坎者，铜质隐隐内涵空绿。生金穴者，金星粲粲内涵空青，总取得肝胆之精灵，通空窍之风气也。予尝以此验之。考之张果《玉洞要诀》云∶空青似杨梅，受赤金之精，甲乙阴灵之气，近泉而生，故能含润，然必新从坎中出者，则钻破中有水，若出矿日久则干如珠矣，安有藏久不干之理。近世必以中空涵浆者为真，若尔则当名空浆，不当名空青矣。但须验其中空，内有青绿如珠者，即真空青。急不可得，绿青可以代用，活法在人，可执一乎。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153209-c88dy48","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614153209-c88dy48"}},{"ID":"20240614153210-sdq3org","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614153210-sdq3org","updated":"20240614153215"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"空青《玉楸药解》"}]},{"ID":"20240614153210-f4hqv9j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153210-f4hqv9j","updated":"20240614153210"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，性寒，入足厥阴肝经。磨翳明目，化积行瘀。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153210-749q5ak","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153210-749q5ak","updated":"20240614153210"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"空青清肝破滞，治目昏眼痛、赤肿障翳，通经下乳，利水消癥。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153210-0prqh6w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153210-0prqh6w","updated":"20240614153210"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石子如卵，内含水浆，摇之有声，其名空青，点久年翳膜青盲，壳亦磨障。亦有内裹白面者，搽肿毒疮疖甚效。亦空青之别种，极难得也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153113-fe11oou","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614153113-fe11oou"}},{"ID":"20240614153148-mhnnmqj","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614153148-mhnnmqj","updated":"20240614153152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"空青《本草求真》"}]},{"ID":"20240614153148-orni5e3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153148-orni5e3","updated":"20240614153148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（石）泻肝积热除内外目翳"}]},{"ID":"20240614153148-qcr9d7j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153148-qcr9d7j","updated":"20240614153148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"空青（专入肝）。感铜精气而结。故专入肝明目。盖人得水气之清者为肝血。其精英则为胆汁。开窍于目。血者五脏之英。注之为神。胆汁充则目明。减则目昏。铜亦清阳之气所生。其气之清者为绿。犹肝血也。其精英为空青之浆。犹胆汁也。其为治目神药。盖亦以类相感耳。（出时珍）况人多怒则火起于肝。水虚则火起于肾。故生内外翳障。得此甘酸大寒以除积热及火。兼之以酸则火自敛。兼得金以平木。故治赤肿青盲。其空青所含之浆。可取点眼。壳亦磨翳要药。书云不怕人间多瞎眼。只愁世上无空青。但空青中水久则干。必须验其中空内有青绿如朱者即是。如无绿。青亦可。不必拘泥。（圣济录治黑翳覆瞳。用空青矾石烧各一两。贝子四枚。研细日点。）"}]},{"ID":"20240614153114-gjsgrxo","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614153114-gjsgrxo"}},{"ID":"20240614153138-cr7mgyd","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614153138-cr7mgyd","updated":"20240614153143"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"空青《本草崇原》"}]},{"ID":"20240614153138-9iwq6yc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153138-9iwq6yc","updated":"20240614153138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味甘酸寒，无毒。主治青盲，耳聋，明目，利九窍，通血脉，养精神，益肝气。欠服轻身延年。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153138-3jlzpku","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153138-3jlzpku","updated":"20240614153138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（空青一名杨梅青，始出益州山谷及越隽山，今蔚兰、宣梓诸州有铜处，铜精熏则生空青，大者如拳如卵，小者如豆粒，或如杨梅。其色青，其中皆空，故曰空青。内有浆汁，为治目神药。不空无浆者，白青也。今方家以药涂铜物上，生青刮下，伪作空青，真者不可得。）"}]},{"ID":"20240614153114-lp2lwxi","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614153114-lp2lwxi"}},{"ID":"20240614153124-oa6321s","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614153124-oa6321s","updated":"20240614153132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"空青《本草图经》"}]},{"ID":"20240614153124-6p5ht70","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153124-6p5ht70","updated":"20240614153126"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"空青"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，生益州山谷及越 山有铜处，铜精熏则生空青。今信州亦时有之，状若杨梅，故别名杨梅青。其腹中空，破之有浆者绝难得。亦有大者如鸡子，小者如豆子，三月中旬采，亦无时。古方虽稀用，而今治眼翳障为最要之物。又曾青所出与此同山，疗体颇相似，而色理亦无异，但其形累累如连珠相缀，今极难得。又有白青，出豫章山谷，亦似空青，圆如铁珠，色白而腹不空，亦谓之碧青，以其研之色碧也。亦谓之鱼目青，以其形似鱼目也。无空青时，亦可用，今不复见之。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153114-972wa5d","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614153114-972wa5d"}},{"ID":"20240614153115-wm558ir","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614153115-wm558ir","updated":"20240614153118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"空青《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240614153115-k3yvn58","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153115-k3yvn58","updated":"20240614153115"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘、酸，寒、大寒，无毒。主青盲、耳聋，明目，利九窍，通血脉，养精神，益肝气，疗目赤痛，去肤翳，止泪出，利水道，下乳汁，通关节，破坚积。久服轻身延年不老，令人不忘，志高、神仙。能化铜、铁、铅、锡作金。生益州山谷及越 山有铜处。铜精熏则生空青，其腹中空。三月中旬采，亦无时。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153115-ujr6lxz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153115-ujr6lxz","updated":"20240614153115"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"越 属益州。今出铜官者，色最鲜深，出始兴者弗如，益州诸郡无复有，恐久不采之故也。凉州西平郡有空青山，亦甚多。今空青但圆实如铁珠，无空腹者，皆凿土石中取之。又以合丹成，则化铅为金矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153115-hhnevfb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153115-hhnevfb","updated":"20240614153115"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"诸石药中，惟此最贵。医方乃稀用之，而多充画也，殊为可惜。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153115-0d9kt9y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153115-0d9kt9y","updated":"20240614153115"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔谨案〕此物出铜处有，乃兼诸青，但空青为难得。今出蔚州、兰州、宣州、梓州，宣州者最好，块段细，时有腹中空者；蔚州、兰州者，片块大，色极深，无空腹者。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153037-x9809mh","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614153037-x9809mh"}},{"ID":"20240614153104-fms7gvt","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614153104-fms7gvt","updated":"20240614153108"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"空青《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240614153104-jyhqjbo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153104-jyhqjbo","updated":"20240614153104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「释名」亦名杨梅青。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153104-zqsl2wc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153104-zqsl2wc","updated":"20240614153104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「气味」甘、酸、寒、无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153104-x70xpsy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153104-x70xpsy","updated":"20240614153104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「主治」"}]},{"ID":"20240614153104-fj0vu2m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153104-fj0vu2m","updated":"20240614153104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、眼睛昏花不明。用空青少许，露一夜，次日，点眼。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153104-6t6rtxj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153104-6t6rtxj","updated":"20240614153104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、翳障。用空青、矾石（烧过）各一两，贝子四枚，共研细，每日点眼。又方：空青二钱，蕤仁（去皮）一两，片脑三钱，共研细，每日点眼。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153104-7jrwj02","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153104-7jrwj02","updated":"20240614153104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、各种目疾（雀目、赤目、青盲、内外障翳、风眼等）。用空青（洗净）、胡黄连（洗）各二钱半，先取槐芽（天未明时乘露采得）适量，装于青竹筒内，悬挂起来，等候干燥。干后研细，取一钱半，与空青、胡黄连共研为末，再加龙脑少许，收存备用。病人每于睡前漱口后，仰头让人吹此药入两鼻内，随即安睡。效果显著。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153104-2o2h3pa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153104-2o2h3pa","updated":"20240614153104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、中风口。用豆大的空青一粒含口中，甚见效。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153037-4l18ba5","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614153037-4l18ba5"}},{"ID":"20240614153053-u1z0tkm","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614153053-u1z0tkm","updated":"20240614153058"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"空青《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240614153053-ku9dhsx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153053-ku9dhsx","updated":"20240614153053"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘酸，寒，大寒，无毒。主青盲耳聋，明目，利九窍，通血脉，养精神，益肝气。疗目赤痛，去肤翳，止泪出，利水道，下乳汁，通关节，破坚积。久服轻身延年不老，令人不忘，志高神仙。能化铜铁铅锡作金。生益州山谷及越 山有铜处，铜精熏则生空青，其腹中空。三月中旬采，亦无时。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153037-aerik8b","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614153037-aerik8b"}},{"ID":"20240614153038-dhnjth1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614153038-dhnjth1","updated":"20240614153047"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"空青《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240614153038-2lvvali","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153038-2lvvali","updated":"20240614153038"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"空青酸寒利窍关，能治头风眼不看，开聋破积通血脉，强志养神最益肝。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153038-uxi1ppw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153038-uxi1ppw","updated":"20240614153038"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石壳中空，有汁青色，无毒。利关节九窍，故治头风耳聋，目盲赤肿翳泪，瞳人破者可使复明。兼破坚积，通血利水，下乳汁，强志养精益用。点眼用汁，磨翳去壳，畏菟丝子。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153038-ksz3yy5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153038-ksz3yy5","updated":"20240614153038"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以上治风通用。"}]},{"ID":"20240606171332-d0k6rit","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240606171332-d0k6rit"}},{"ID":"20240606171347-5qobtmv","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-5qobtmv","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：空青"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-mf237wi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-mf237wi","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-dy87o8t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-dy87o8t","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Kōnɡ Qīnɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-7wyi48m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-7wyi48m","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-zsrof18","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-zsrof18","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 青油羽、青神羽（《石药尔雅》），杨梅青（《本草图经》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-czmbk0n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-czmbk0n","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-hx0r8qf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-hx0r8qf","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本经》"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-a730fm8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-a730fm8","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-5dijewk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-5dijewk","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为碳酸盐类矿物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"蓝铜矿"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的矿石，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"成球形或中空者"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-b10kjsn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-b10kjsn","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-fgngcca","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-fgngcca","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本草经疏》:\"入肝。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-mes5t5u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-mes5t5u","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-ivs9kh6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-ivs9kh6","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 甘酸，寒。有小毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-msf3xre","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-msf3xre","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》:\"味甘，寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-uwjpd0a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-uwjpd0a","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《吴普本草》:\"神农:甘酸。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-ol9hch2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-ol9hch2","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《别录》:\"酸，大寒，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-skm41ll","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-skm41ll","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《玉楸药解》:\"味苦，性寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-u75ugye","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-u75ugye","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-6w1ghgp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-6w1ghgp","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《药性论》:\"畏菟丝子。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-g0bt7rz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-g0bt7rz","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-z3qotcm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-z3qotcm","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 明目，去翳，利窍。治青盲，雀目，翳膜内障，赤眼肿痛，中风口歪，手臂不仁，头风，耳聋。"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-rx7vv1z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-rx7vv1z","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》:\"主青盲，耳聋，明目，利九窍，通血脉。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-1t6cde4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-1t6cde4","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》:\"益肝气，疗目赤痛，去肤翳，止泪出，利水道，下乳汁，通关节，破坚积，令人不忘。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-eqgb3ws","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-eqgb3ws","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《药性论》:\"能治头风，镇肝，瞳人破者，再得见物。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-tt3hi55","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-tt3hi55","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《日华子本草》:\"浆能点多年青盲、内障、翳膜，养精气。其壳又可摩翳。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-7gpse7e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-7gpse7e","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《范汪方》:\"治中风口歪不正，以豆许含咽。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-echgxyn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-echgxyn","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-nzps175","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-nzps175","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 外用:研细水飞点眼。内服:研末，1～3分。"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-orf8yme","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-orf8yme","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-zvg0x61","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-zvg0x61","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治眼疏疏不明:空青少许，渍露一宿，以水点之。（《普济方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-hebsbgy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-hebsbgy","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治眼黑翳覆瞳子肤起:贝子四枚（烧），空青一两，矾石一两（熬汁尽）。上三味末，取如黍米注翳上，日二。（《僧深集方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-u5zbvxw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-u5zbvxw","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治肤翳昏暗:空青二钱，蕤仁（去皮）一两，片脑三钱。细研日点。（《圣济总录》）"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-jhd0p5q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-jhd0p5q","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治雀目及内外障眼，风毒青盲、暴赤眼等:杨梅青（好者，水浴过，控干、研）、胡黄连（水浴过，为细末）各一分，槐芽（初出如雀舌时，不计多少，侯干为末）一钱半。三味同研匀细如粉，入龙脑一字许，更研匀，密收，每夜卧时，先温水净漱口，仰面卧，用苇筒子吹药一字，入两鼻中，但令如常喘息，便自睡着，眼中觉凉冷为妙，隔夜一次。（《圣济总录》空青散）"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-4jh5b81","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-4jh5b81","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治卒中风，手臂不仁，口歪僻:空青末一豆许，著口中，渐入咽即愈。（《补缺肘后方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-ebuqc96","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-ebuqc96","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-5rarxaa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-5rarxaa","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本草经疏》:\"空青甘寒能除积热，兼之以酸，则火自敛而降矣；热退则障自消，目自明。耳者肾之窍，水涸火炎，故耳聋，肾家热解，则火启水生，而声复聪矣。九窍不利，无非火壅，肝家有火，则血热气逆，故血脉不通，凉肝除热，则精气自益，阴足火清，则窍自利而血脉自通，精神自长矣。目赤痛、肤翳、泪出，皆肝气不足之侯，益肝气则诸证自除矣。其曰利水道，下乳汁，通关节，破坚积者，皆以热除则气血和平，阴气自复，五脏清宁则诸证自解。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-dfni6x0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-dfni6x0","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-ucc78i9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-ucc78i9","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-yr2dhyw","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-yr2dhyw","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》《中药大辞典》：空青"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-44u5znw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-44u5znw","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-m7frz1i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-m7frz1i","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Kōnɡ Qīnɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-08uqx8n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-08uqx8n","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-yb5l4gr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-yb5l4gr","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 青油羽、青神羽、杨梅青"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-xw9z4nw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-xw9z4nw","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-dnskdmd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-dnskdmd","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Azurite (globular or hollow)"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-enro2sw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-enro2sw","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-ii8cje0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-ii8cje0","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自《神农本草经》。"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-jme6x1a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-jme6x1a","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《别录》：空青，生益州山谷及越嵩山有铜处，铜精熏则生空青，其腹中空。三月中旬采，亦无时。"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-zh4mt7u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-zh4mt7u","updated":"20240606171419"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.陶弘景：空青，越嵩属益州，今出铜官者，色最鲜深，出始兴者，弗如，益州诸郡无复有，恐久不采之故也。凉州西平郡有空青山，亦甚多。今空青但圆实如铁珠，无空腹者，皆凿土石中取之。又以合丹，成则化讼为金矣。诸石药中惟此最贵，医方乃稀用之。"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-ytsti3c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-ytsti3c","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《唐本草》：此物出铜处有，"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-7j6cadb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-7j6cadb","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-lxvoxzy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-lxvoxzy","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为碳酸盐类矿物蓝铜矿的矿石，成球形或中空者。"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-rl68rza","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-rl68rza","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Azurite"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-zm5yfju","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-zm5yfju","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-59dtypp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-59dtypp","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：成因产状与绿青（孔雀石）相似。当温度增高时，扁青（蓝铜矿）可能变为绿青（孔雀石），而当干燥季节，并在有足够数量碳酸的条件下，绿青（孔雀石）可转变为扁青（蓝铜 矿）。共存有孔雀石、石英、褐铁矿乃至其他粘土矿物。"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-zgi53wg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-zgi53wg","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：产于吉林、辽宁、内蒙古、青海、湖北、湖南、广东、四川、西藏等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-3das8n5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-3das8n5","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-16ix6vk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-16ix6vk","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 单斜晶系。晶体短柱状或板状。通常呈粒状、肾状、散射状、土状等块体或被覆在其他铜矿之表面，呈深蓝色。条痕为浅篮色。光泽呈玻璃状、金刚石状或土状。半透明至不透明。断口呈贝壳状，硬度3.5-4。比重3.7-3.9。性脆。"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-v3v8pah","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-v3v8pah","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-w7o2hw3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-w7o2hw3","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 性状鉴别 本品为类球状，大小不一。蓝色。表面不平坦。多数中空。"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-fttdcze","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-fttdcze","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-ql1cl71","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-ql1cl71","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 主含碱式碳酸铜[2CuCO3·Cu(OH)2]。其中氧化铜(CuO)69.2%，二氧化碳(CO2)25.6%，水分(H2O)5.2%,尚含铅、锌、铜、钙、镁、钛、铁、铝等元素。"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-zn3ufio","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-zn3ufio","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鉴别"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-lfae0xp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-lfae0xp","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" (1)取本品粉末，加入稀盐酸，显碳酸盐的各种反应。详见“绿青”条。"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-albfy7j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-albfy7j","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"(2)本品具铜盐的各种反应。详见“绿青”条。"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-lyl98v6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-lyl98v6","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"(3)X射线衍射分析曲线 5.18(6),5.09(8),4.98(6),3.53(10),2.51(5)。"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-p35xxaf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-p35xxaf","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"(4)差热分析曲线 吸热390℃(大)，980℃（大）；放热780℃（微），970℃（微）；390℃（微）失重40%。"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-yor3y5d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-yor3y5d","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经肝经"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-j7ysegj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-j7ysegj","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味甘酸；寒；有小毒"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-xtuv79k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-xtuv79k","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-92lepii","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-92lepii","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《药性论》：畏菟丝子。"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-ahxlryv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-ahxlryv","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-bale24p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-bale24p","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 凉肝清热；明目去翳；活血利窍。主目赤肿痛；青盲；雀目；翳膜内障；中风口；手臂不仁；头风；耳聋"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-u7x4h4g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-u7x4h4g","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-b7bc9i2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-b7bc9i2","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 外用：研细水飞点眼。内服：研末，1-3分。"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-vbs15wr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-vbs15wr","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-lkttbu5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-lkttbu5","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《本草经疏》：空青甘寒能除积热，兼之以酸，则火自敛而降矣；热退则障自消，目自明。耳者肾之窍，水涸火炎，故耳聋，肾家热解，则火息水生，而声复聪矣。九窍不利，无非火壅，肝家有火，则血热气逆，故血脉不通，凉肝除热，则精气自益，阴足火清，则窍自利而血脉自通，精神自长矣。目赤痛、肤翳、泪出，皆肝气不足之候，益肝气则诸证自除矣。其曰利水道，下乳汁，通关节，破坚积者，皆以热除则气血和平，阴气自复，五脏清宁则诸证自解。"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-13bmmyf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-13bmmyf","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本经》：主青盲，耳聋，明目，利九窍，通血脉。"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-057baix","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-057baix","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《别录》：益肝气，疗目赤痛，去肤翳，止泪出，利水道，下乳汁，通关节，破坚积，令人不忘。"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-49fjpgp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-49fjpgp","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《药性论》：能治头风，镇肝，瞳人破者，再得见物。"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-ue4zfaw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-ue4zfaw","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《日华子本草》：浆能点多年青盲、内障、翳膜，养精气。其壳又可摩翳。"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-nx627wy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-nx627wy","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《范汪方》：治中风口歪不正，以豆许含咽。"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-3sm67rs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-3sm67rs","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240606171347-nzfwbcq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171347-nzfwbcq","updated":"20240606171347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240606171349-spzojsa","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240606171349-spzojsa"}},{"ID":"20240606171350-wu6qwgw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606171350-wu6qwgw"}}]}